<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>80G certificate — {{receipt_number}}</title>
  <style>
    @page { size: A4; margin: 20mm 16mm; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Mukta', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #1A0A00;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      font-size: 11.5pt;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }
    .frame {
      border: 2.5px solid #C8941F;
      padding: 22px 26px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .inner {
      border: 1px solid #E6D8C2;
      padding: 22px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .head {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .head .seal {
      display: inline-block;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E6C26B 0%, #C8941F 100%);
      color: #5C1010;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 10pt;
    }
    .head h1 {
      font-family: 'Tiro Devanagari Sanskrit', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 22pt;
      color: #7A1818;
      margin: 8px 0 4px 0;
    }
    .head .org-meta {
      color: #8B6F5E;
      font-size: 10pt;
    }
    .body p {
      margin: 10px 0;
    }
    .lbl-inline {
      color: #8B6F5E;
      font-size: 10pt;
      letter-spacing: .04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .val-strong {
      color: #1A0A00;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .mono {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .summary {
      margin: 16px 0;
      padding: 16px;
      background: #FAF1DC;
      border-left: 4px solid #C8941F;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
    .summary .amount {
      font-family: 'Tiro Devanagari Sanskrit', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 24pt;
      color: #C8941F;
    }
    .sign {
      margin-top: 36px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .sign .col {
      width: 48%;
    }
    .sign .line {
      border-top: 1px solid #8B6F5E;
      margin-top: 36px;
      padding-top: 4px;
      font-size: 9.5pt;
      color: #8B6F5E;
    }
    .foot {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 9.5pt;
      color: #8B6F5E;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px dashed #C4A882;
      padding-top: 8px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="frame">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="head">
        <div class="seal">80G CERTIFICATE</div>
        <h1>{{trust_name}}</h1>
        <div class="org-meta">{{trust_address}}</div>
        <div class="org-meta">PAN: <span class="mono">{{trust_pan}}</span> &middot; 80G Reg.: <span class="mono">{{registration_number}}</span></div>
        <div class="org-meta">Section {{section}} of the Income-tax Act, 1961</div>
      </div>

      <div class="body">
        <p>
          <span class="lbl-inline">Certificate no.</span>
          &nbsp;<span class="mono val-strong">{{receipt_number}}</span>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;
          <span class="lbl-inline">Financial year</span>
          &nbsp;<span class="val-strong">{{financial_year}}</span>
        </p>
        <p>
          This is to certify that <b>{{donor_name}}</b>
          {{#if donor_pan_masked}}(PAN <span class="mono">{{donor_pan_masked}}</span>){{/if}}
          has made a donation to <b>{{trust_name}}</b> on
          <b>{{captured_on_display}}</b> via Razorpay payment ID
          <span class="mono">{{razorpay_payment_id}}</span> for the purpose of
          <b>{{purpose_label}}</b>.
        </p>

        <div class="summary">
          <div class="lbl-inline">Donation received</div>
          <div class="amount">₹{{amount_inr_display}}</div>
          <div style="color:#8B6F5E; font-size:10pt;">Currency: {{currency}}</div>
        </div>

        <p>
          This donation is eligible for deduction under Section {{section}} of the
          Income-tax Act, 1961, subject to the conditions specified therein. The
          donor is advised to retain this certificate for filing income-tax
          returns.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="sign">
        <div class="col">
          <div class="line">Date of issue · {{issued_on_display}}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="col" style="text-align:right;">
          <div class="line">Authorised signatory, {{trust_name}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="foot">
        Computer-generated certificate. Valid without a physical signature.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
